<title>GREECE: Greek Vector in trading debut.</title>
<headline>Greek Vector in trading debut.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek Vector Metal Works made its trading debut on the main market of the Athens bourse on Friday.</p>
<p>Vector raised 853 million drachmas by going public at 1,300 drachmas a share.</p>
<p>Shares of Vector will not be subject to the 8.0 percent maximum allowable volatility limit for the first three days of trading following a decision by the capital markets commission. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
